WEBVTT

00:17.350 --> 00:19.010
Poor kitty...

00:20.070 --> 00:22.670
Hey, could you close your eyes for a while?

00:24.290 --> 00:26.590
Till I say you can open them again. No peeking!

00:28.390 --> 00:30.010
Why?

00:30.010 --> 00:32.840
You can open your eyes now. Here.

00:33.440 --> 00:35.490
Awesome! How did you do that?

00:35.490 --> 00:36.600
It's a secret.

00:36.600 --> 00:38.260
Okay...

00:38.260 --> 00:39.890
Thanks!

00:46.630 --> 00:48.460
Good morning, Kawakami!

00:50.080 --> 00:51.290
Good morning...

00:51.290 --> 00:52.480
Let's get going.

00:53.760 --> 00:56.100
School! We're going to be late.

01:03.990 --> 01:09.960
Stars Intertwined

01:04.580 --> 01:09.550
<i>Kuttskukiboshi</i>
- Stars Intertwined -<i></i>

01:10.990 --> 01:15.520
As thou becometh father to thy son,

01:15.520 --> 01:18.680
swearest thou an oath unto the world beyond...

01:15.520 --> 01:20.560
<i>Aaya Saitou transferred to our class this spring.</i>

01:20.560 --> 01:23.230
And for the next passage... Saitou.

01:23.230 --> 01:29.460
<i>To me, her voice is more beautiful than any other sound in the world.</i>

01:41.390 --> 01:44.320
<i>And the wind exists...</i>

01:44.320 --> 01:47.890
<i>to put a sigh through her hair...</i>

01:48.790 --> 01:52.490
...but this protein known as haemoglobin, found in red blood cells...

01:52.490 --> 02:01.060
Just her presence was more important than anything else in the world.

02:10.750 --> 02:12.150
Kawakami...

02:16.550 --> 02:17.790
Were you listening?

02:17.790 --> 02:20.010
And your face is pretty red.

02:20.010 --> 02:21.310
Is something wrong?

02:21.310 --> 02:23.350
Uh, no. Nothing...

02:23.350 --> 02:26.490
That blush in her cheeks, that right there is the haemoglobin.

02:27.370 --> 02:29.020
Now you'll all remember!

02:29.020 --> 02:33.160
Well, then, everyone stay focused and disciplined over the summer break!

02:33.160 --> 02:34.240
Class dismissed!

02:34.240 --> 02:36.620
Stand.

02:36.620 --> 02:38.210
Bow.

02:43.480 --> 02:45.410
Call me if there's something you don't understand.

02:45.410 --> 02:46.290
Thank you!

02:46.290 --> 02:47.940
Only for the parts I know, okay?

02:47.940 --> 02:49.560
Got it. Bye-bye!

03:05.640 --> 03:08.630
Let's do our usual thing today.

03:14.840 --> 03:16.330
Follow me!

03:22.690 --> 03:24.550
Had enough already?

03:24.550 --> 03:27.590
Yeah... I can't take any more...

03:29.450 --> 03:32.430
It moved! A new record!

03:32.430 --> 03:35.460
I really think your powers are getting stronger!

03:35.880 --> 03:40.730
Saitou... You treat me like a guinea pig or something.

03:40.730 --> 03:41.670
Exper—

03:41.670 --> 03:45.730
When you had that traffic accident a year ago, did anything else change?

03:45.730 --> 03:48.230
Oh... Back then...

03:48.230 --> 03:50.300
By the time I woke up at the hospital,

03:50.300 --> 03:53.040
I was already like this, somehow...

03:53.040 --> 03:54.120
Okay.

03:54.120 --> 03:57.610
It must have been the shock that brought out your powers.

03:57.610 --> 03:59.700
Do you have other powers, like predicting the future?

03:59.700 --> 04:04.950
Umm... I'm just able to move objects without touching them, but...

04:06.100 --> 04:08.740
— Can we stop now?
— No way.

04:08.740 --> 04:12.530
I want to make those powers a secret between us.

04:13.560 --> 04:16.870
Hey... Follow me.

04:32.020 --> 04:33.970
No way!

04:33.970 --> 04:35.150
That was close...

04:35.600 --> 04:39.800
I don't know why, but this tree didn't burn down even in the air raids.

04:39.800 --> 04:43.080
That's why I think there's a great well of energy sleeping in here.

04:45.250 --> 04:47.580
Let's receive some of its energy.

04:52.130 --> 04:53.570
You try it.

04:55.860 --> 05:00.160
<i>As long as I keep this secret, I have no choice but to do what she says.</i>

05:01.360 --> 05:02.800
<i>But...</i>

05:02.800 --> 05:07.370
<i>Actually, there's another secret that she doesn't know about.</i>

05:08.350 --> 05:10.790
<i>The fact that ever since we met...</i>

05:10.790 --> 05:15.800
<i>I've been in love with everything about Aaya Saitou.</i>

05:45.910 --> 05:47.600
Saitou?

06:27.710 --> 06:29.150
Oh, my god!

06:29.150 --> 06:31.210
What am I doing?

06:58.760 --> 07:03.900
The school during summer vacation is somehow... otherworldly.

07:04.500 --> 07:11.360
The empty morning campus seems almost like our own private castle.

07:12.400 --> 07:15.630
I couldn't find one to my liking, so I made it myself.

07:15.630 --> 07:17.790
What, a puzzle ring?

07:17.790 --> 07:20.780
No, this isn't a puzzle you can solve.

07:20.780 --> 07:22.850
Wow... You're so clever.

07:22.850 --> 07:27.030
I thought that maybe you'd be able to separate these with your powers.

07:27.030 --> 07:29.400
Really? I'm not too sure.

07:29.400 --> 07:31.630
In other words, you're still experimenting with me.

07:31.630 --> 07:34.200
— It's two different matters!
— Okay, I get it!

07:39.010 --> 07:42.560
I can't do it, after all. Things like these are impossible.

07:43.600 --> 07:45.390
Or is it... possible?

07:46.310 --> 07:49.570
Sometimes, it happens before you've realized.

07:52.530 --> 07:55.590
I want you to try at this every day.

07:55.590 --> 07:58.870
And if you can see the future, tell me immediately!

07:58.870 --> 08:02.030
Sure. But seeing into the future is...

08:03.470 --> 08:05.440
Your nails are so pretty.

08:06.180 --> 08:08.310
Aaya, you're wearing mascara?

08:08.310 --> 08:10.700
Yeah... Does it look weird...?

08:11.000 --> 08:12.330
It's gorgeous!

08:12.330 --> 08:14.670
You look really cute in anything.

08:14.670 --> 08:17.750
Thanks! But even if you flatter me—

08:18.630 --> 08:20.360
I have it.

08:22.350 --> 08:24.590
And I also brought eyelash curlers.

08:25.900 --> 08:28.100
Kiichan, you should put some on, too! I'll do it for you!

08:28.100 --> 08:29.930
Yes, please.

09:12.530 --> 09:14.660
Couldn't you foresee this?

09:14.660 --> 09:16.400
I can't. You talk too mu—

09:16.810 --> 09:19.020
Even though you knew it was coming?

10:14.140 --> 10:17.300
Aaya... You haven't been wearing underwear this whole time?

10:17.300 --> 10:18.830
Isn't it hot?

10:18.830 --> 10:20.300
I'm sweating...

10:29.340 --> 10:31.160
It feels great!

10:31.160 --> 10:32.680
Kiichan, come in!

10:33.340 --> 10:34.880
Yup.

10:34.880 --> 10:37.750
Hey, are you sure this is a good idea?

10:37.750 --> 10:40.080
Well, our school doesn't have a swimming club.

10:40.080 --> 10:42.800
But if anyone comes...

10:42.800 --> 10:47.530
They won't! Because this is our secret private bath time!

10:50.320 --> 10:54.000
Aaya... You're kinda... horny, aren't you?

10:54.330 --> 10:55.480
Yeah, I am!

11:08.880 --> 11:11.880
We did so many dirty things today that I'm worn out!

11:11.880 --> 11:15.710
Aaya! It would be embarrassing if someone heard that!

11:15.710 --> 11:18.920
It just tempts me more when you get all embarrassed.

11:21.430 --> 11:23.530
Let's buy ice cream over there!

11:23.530 --> 11:25.190
What flavor would you like?

11:28.210 --> 11:31.280
I want it to taste like your —

11:32.900 --> 11:35.610
Geez, you pervert!

11:47.330 --> 11:52.050
What's gonna happen to us from now on, I wonder...

11:55.320 --> 11:59.160
Sorry, we don't have to talk about it.

11:59.160 --> 12:02.340
It seems that I love you so much...

12:02.340 --> 12:04.160
that I wilted.

12:09.140 --> 12:10.760
Aaya...

12:12.800 --> 12:16.240
Let's make lots of love again tomorrow.

12:16.240 --> 12:17.560
Yeah.

12:18.270 --> 12:21.180
Kiichan's thigh flavor...

12:50.180 --> 12:52.180
From: Saitou, Aaya
Sorry! (>o<)> I'm feeling a bit unwell 2day, so no experiments~ ^.^

12:52.180 --> 12:55.750
omg, r u @ skul already? I'm so sorry!! oh but I'm not srsly sick,
so dun worry >_<; I'll def go 2moro ok? <3333

13:04.650 --> 13:06.080
Sorry!

13:07.430 --> 13:08.380
Come in.

13:08.380 --> 13:09.000
Thanks.

13:15.360 --> 13:17.070
Is coffee all right?

13:17.070 --> 13:20.170
Oh, no, no. Sick people need to sleep.

13:20.170 --> 13:23.680
Uh... I'm not actually... sick...

13:25.100 --> 13:27.450
My flow is kind of... heavy today.

13:28.170 --> 13:29.730
Are you all right?

13:29.730 --> 13:31.620
Yup, I'm okay.

13:32.980 --> 13:35.890
In any case, you should lie down.

13:35.890 --> 13:37.410
Yes, nurse!

13:39.570 --> 13:42.100
You sure have a lot of instruments here.

13:42.100 --> 13:43.570
They're my brother's.

13:43.570 --> 13:47.140
— Wow... So you have a brother.
— He seldom comes home, though.

13:47.900 --> 13:49.590
Did you manage to separate that?

13:49.590 --> 13:51.280
These stars, right?

13:51.280 --> 13:52.460
No...

13:52.460 --> 13:54.800
But anyway, here. This is for you.

13:55.660 --> 13:58.220
I recommend this.

13:58.220 --> 14:00.720
I've been listening to this since junior high...

14:00.720 --> 14:03.090
— Perhaps you know it?
— Yeah.

14:03.090 --> 14:04.710
Really? I guess you would.

14:04.710 --> 14:07.460
— I'm back.
— Welcome back!

14:07.700 --> 14:10.360
— Your friend?
— Kawakami, my classmate.

14:13.750 --> 14:15.440
Sorry to disturb you.

14:16.890 --> 14:18.280
How are you?

14:23.450 --> 14:24.360
Um...

14:25.370 --> 14:26.900
Huh?

14:26.900 --> 14:29.440
What... Seriously?

14:30.610 --> 14:32.050
Yeah.

14:37.230 --> 14:40.680
Your grandfather's a foreigner, so...

14:40.680 --> 14:42.820
A half of a halfie... What do you call that?

14:42.820 --> 14:43.590
A "quarter".

14:45.190 --> 14:49.300
And your brother is going overseas after the summer break?

14:49.300 --> 14:52.150
Yeah... He's going somewhere in Australia...

14:53.060 --> 14:54.470
Stop!

14:55.170 --> 14:56.020
One, two.

15:01.210 --> 15:03.080
Someone might find out!

15:03.670 --> 15:04.900
Sorry...

15:07.410 --> 15:10.350
There are only the two of us in our family,,

15:10.720 --> 15:12.850
so I was planning to go with him.

15:13.460 --> 15:15.250
I've answered question 4.

15:15.250 --> 15:17.350
That's my girl!

15:17.350 --> 15:19.790
You were planning to go with him, but...

15:25.490 --> 15:27.270
I'm not going to go.

15:28.700 --> 15:34.780
<i>I'm so happy it was Aaya who found out about my secret powers.</i>

15:35.610 --> 15:38.150
Oh, hello? It's me.

15:38.570 --> 15:41.640
I'm staying at my friend's place tonight, so I'll get home tomorrow.

15:47.720 --> 15:51.260
It's still impossible to separate that, after all.

15:51.630 --> 15:54.130
I'm sure it's just because you're not trying hard enough.

15:56.140 --> 15:58.730
Well, then I'll try harder.

16:17.640 --> 16:20.350
All right, I'll see you tomorrow at school.

16:20.350 --> 16:22.450
I'll text you.

16:57.300 --> 16:58.230
Yeah.

17:53.190 --> 17:55.830
Maybe she's not home yet...

17:56.670 --> 17:57.660
There's no choice!

18:06.380 --> 18:08.680
Excuse me.

18:56.980 --> 18:58.110
Kiichan!

18:58.110 --> 18:59.160
Wait!

19:25.790 --> 19:27.730
They're separated...

19:34.050 --> 19:35.820
They separated...

19:35.230 --> 19:40.170
And the more we wish with our fingers interlocked,

19:40.170 --> 19:43.280
the more our wish comes true

19:43.510 --> 19:50.370
If we can stay the way we are now,

19:50.370 --> 19:57.290
it doesn't matter if we disappear

19:57.290 --> 20:04.600
Because those intertwined stars in that sky

20:04.600 --> 20:12.580
will watch over us
